---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Reveal from "../components/Reveal.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions - Surfing Life Guest House"
  description="Terms and conditions for booking and staying at Surfing Life Guest House & Restaurant, Weligama, Sri Lanka."
>
  <main id="main-content" class="min-h-screen bg-white py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <Reveal direction="up">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Booking and Reservations</h2>
            <p>
              All bookings are subject to availability and confirmation. We reserve the right to refuse service to
              anyone for any reason at any time.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-2">
              <li>Check-in time is 2:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM</li>
              <li>Early check-in and late check-out are subject to availability</li>
              <li>Valid ID and credit card are required at check-in</li>
              <li>Room rates are subject to change without notice</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Cancellation Policy</h2>
            <p>Our cancellation policy is designed to be fair to both our guests and our business:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-2">
              <li>Free cancellation up to 48 hours before check-in</li>
              <li>50% charge for cancellations within 48 hours of check-in</li>
              <li>100% charge for no-shows</li>
              <li>Special rates and packages may have different cancellation policies</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Surfing Activities</h2>
            <p>While we provide surfing-related services, we want to ensure the safety of all our guests:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-2">
              <li>All surfing activities are undertaken at your own risk</li>
              <li>Guests must sign a waiver before participating in surfing activities</li>
              <li>We recommend having travel insurance that covers water sports</li>
              <li>Weather conditions may affect surfing activities</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Property Rules</h2>
            <p>To ensure a comfortable stay for all guests, please follow these rules:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-2">
              <li>No smoking in rooms or common areas</li>
              <li>Quiet hours from 10:00 PM to 7:00 AM</li>
              <li>Pets are not allowed unless specifically arranged</li>
              <li>Please report any damages or issues immediately</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Liability</h2>
            <p>Surfing Life is not liable for:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-2">
              <li>Personal injury during surfing activities</li>
              <li>Loss or damage to personal belongings</li>
              <li>Changes in weather conditions affecting activities</li>
              <li>Third-party services or activities</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
            <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to the website.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">7. Contact Information</h2>
            <p>For any questions regarding these terms and conditions, please contact us at:</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Phone: +94 777 401 667</p>
            <p>Email: info@surfinglife.com</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </Reveal>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
